OL,3,GNEWSATwo women found dead inside house
OL,4,
OL,5,FTwo women have been found dead inside a
OL,6,Fhouse in Kenilworth, said police.
OL,8,FWarwickshire Police officers discovered
OL,9,Ftheir bodies in Rounds Hill, on Sunday
OL,10,Fevening after neighbours reported
OL,11,Fconcern.
OL,13,FThe force said the deaths are not being
OL,14,Ftreated as suspicious.
OL,16,FParamedics from West Midlands Ambulance
OL,17,FService were also called to the
OL,18,Fproperty just before 18:00 BST but were
OL,19,Funable to assist the victims - and
OL,20,Fconfirmed they found dead at the scene.
